{"title":"Sirocco","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 40 Dust Devil that attacks with corrode (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 12 times (1.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: mireChance: .35</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/sirocco-core\">Sirocco Core</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sirocco\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/sirocco?lv=39\">Lv 39 <span>1,081</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sirocco?lv=40\">Lv 40 <span>939</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sirocco?lv=41\">Lv 41 <span>226</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/sirocco\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>39</b></td><td>185</td><td>26</td><td>1,950</td><td class=\"muted\">555 · 36.4 · 5,850</td><td>1,081</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sirocco?lv=40\" title=\"Pick level 40\"><td><b>40</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>194</td><td>26.5</td><td>2,000</td><td class=\"muted\">582 · 37.1 · 6,000</td><td>939</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sirocco?lv=41\" title=\"Pick level 41\"><td><b>41</b></td><td>203</td><td>27.1</td><td>2,050</td><td class=\"muted\">609 · 37.9 · 6,150</td><td>226</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sirocco\" data-map-level=\"39\">Show level 39 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 296 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dust-mote\" title=\"Dust Mote - in 212 of 296 looted corpses, 208 recorded drops, 517 total, 1–7 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/1c70ff443aaceb81445a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dust Mote</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1–7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"scoured-glass\" title=\"Scoured Glass - in 204 of 296 looted corpses, 200 recorded drops, 396 total, 1–6 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e3e1e7ee6d4d7434412d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scoured Glass</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–6</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 50 recorded drops, 9,678 total, 33–244 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc